     "We&#39;ve got some R workshops coming up the next couple of weeks at\r<br>#maptimeDavis ...\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>-------- Forwarded Message --------\r<br>Subject: [ucdmappingclub] #maptimeDavis Interactive Maps with R Workshop\r<br>Date: Fri, 25 Jan 2019 23:37:16 +0000\r<br>From: Michele M Tobias &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;\r<br>To: geospatial Sympa List &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geosp...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;, ucdmappingclub Sympa\r<br>List &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ucdmapp...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;, Carrie Armstrong-Ruport\r<br>&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">caru...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;\r<br>\r<br>Learn how to make interactive maps (also known as slippy maps, web maps,\r<br>and a host of other names) in R at the next #maptimeDavis workshop on\r<br>January 30th, 2019 from 10:00 - 12:00 pm in room 360 Shields Library\r<br>(DSI Classroom).  Some prior experience (beginner) with R recommended\r<br>but not required.  Please bring a laptop with R installed.  R Studio is\r<br>recommended.  All are welcome!\r<br>\r<br>More info &amp; to register:\r<br><a href=\"https://spatial.ucdavis.edu/2019/01/23/maptimedavis-interactive-maps-with-r/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://spatial.ucdavis.edu/2019/01/23/maptimedavis-interactive-maps-with-r/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466173319000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1pG1XyKlugLEmz_PKR_u84\">https://spatial.ucdavis.edu/2019/01/23/maptimedavis-interactive-maps-with-r/</a>\r<br>\r<br>I&#39;m happy to answer any questions!\r<br>\r<br>Best,\r<br>Michele\r<br>\r<br>Michele Tobias, PhD\r<br>GIS Data Curator\r<br>Data Management\r<br>Program&lt;<a href=\"https://www.library.ucdavis.edu/service/data-management/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.library.ucdavis.edu/service/data-management/&amp;source=gm